121
00:15:15,024 --> 00:15:18,124
キミの視線独占間違いなしでしょ
I'll make sure your gaze is mine to keep soon enough.

122
00:15:18,424 --> 00:15:21,824
望んで 願って もっともっと求めて
I want it, I need it, come on now, give it up already.

123
00:15:21,824 --> 00:15:25,424
なんでもなれるのキミの思い通り
Whatever you want, whoever you want, I aim to please.

124
00:15:25,524 --> 00:15:27,424
着せ替えて 変身させて
Put on a dress, change my face,

125
00:15:27,424 --> 00:15:31,524
もうどうにでもして ついでに抱きしめて!
whatever you need, all I need is your loving embrace!

126
00:15:32,424 --> 00:15:37,224
Baby Maniacs! 溺れちゃうの
Baby Maniacs! Drown me in your love,

127
00:15:37,224 --> 00:15:40,124
はやくあたしを連れ出して
hurry up and carry me away.

128
