133
00:15:54,024 --> 00:15:56,924
望んで 願って もっともっと求めて
I want it, I need it, come on now, give it up already.

134
00:15:56,924 --> 00:15:59,924
なんでもなれるのキミの思い通り
Whatever you want, whoever you want, I aim to please.

135
00:16:00,024 --> 00:16:02,024
叶えさせて 変わらせて
So just make a wish, and then I'll grant it,

136
00:16:02,024 --> 00:16:04,824
絶対ハート射止めにしてやるから覚悟して!
your heart will be shot down soon, don't forget!

137
00:16:06,424 --> 00:16:09,424
Baby boy! 中毒とまんない
Baby boy! Just wanna take a bite,

138
00:16:09,424 --> 00:16:13,124
はやくあたしを奪って
hurry up and take me far away.

139
00:16:13,324 --> 00:16:16,924
ねえ眼中ないの? その瞳には誰が映っているの?
Hey, are you blind, who's the one on your radar this time around?

140
00:16:17,024 --> 00:16:20,024
キミを振り向かせる為なら どんな手でも使うわ
If I could only just get you to catch my gaze, I'll use any means necessary.

141
00:16:20,224 --> 00:16:23,624
超絶俺様主義のキミに合うのはあたしだけ
I'm the only one who's good enough for you in the end.

142
00:16:23,724 --> 00:16:26,424
ねえあたしの中キミだけなんだ
Yeah, you're the only one I need, open your eyes to the truth.

143
00:16:26,424 --> 00:16:28,924
知らないフリはやめてよ
Please stop this ache in my heart,

144
00:16:28,924 --> 00:16:30,924
この胸の痛みを止めてよ
pull the trigger and take me down!

145
00:16:33,724 --> 00:16:37,224
Baby Maniacs! 溺れちゃうの
Baby Maniacs! Drown me in your love,

146
00:16:37,224 --> 00:16:40,124
はやくあたしを連れ出して
hurry up and carry me away.

147
00:16:40,224 --> 00:16:44,824
ねえ夢中なんだ この瞳にうつるのはひとりだけ
Hey, I may be crazy, but I'll make sure that you only ever look my way.

148
00:16:44,924 --> 00:16:48,124
なんで多幸なんなの? なにな不満なんなの?
Why are you so scared? What drives you freakin' mad?

149
00:16:48,124 --> 00:16:51,124
なんて理不尽に叫んでみたり
Why not choose insanity? Oh come, don't make me scream.

150
00:16:51,224 --> 00:16:54,824
I love you! I need you! あたしはキミにあうために生まれてきたの!
I love you! I need you! I was born to meet you and give you all of my love!

151
00:16:54,824 --> 00:16:58,124
Baby Maniacs! 溺れちゃうの はやくあたしを連れ出して
Baby Maniacs! Drown me in your love, hurry up and carry me away.

152
00:16:58,124 --> 00:17:01,924
ねえ夢中なんだ この瞳にうつるのはひとりだけ
Hey, I may be crazy, but I'll make sure that you only ever look my way.

153
00:17:02,024 --> 00:17:05,024
ふらふらしてて掴まれない 気分屋でマイペース
It's just out of reach now, can't get a grip on my pace,

154
00:17:05,024 --> 00:17:07,824
必殺らぶら光線届きません
those beams are beyond my perception.

155
00:17:07,824 --> 00:17:11,024
そんで視線交差しません なんで?わかりません
You've yet to look, why wait? I don't understand.

156
00:17:11,024 --> 00:17:12,024
キミ成分が足りません!
Don't you know I'm the one you want?

157
00:17:12,124 --> 00:17:15,024
望んで 願って もっともっと求めて
I want it, I need it, come on now, give it up already.

158
00:17:15,024 --> 00:17:18,024
なんでもなれるのキミの思い通り
Whatever you want, whoever you want, I aim to please.

159
00:17:18,024 --> 00:17:20,024
叶えさせて 変わらせて
So just make a wish, and then I'll grant it,

160
00:17:20,024 --> 00:17:22,824
絶対ハート射止めにしてやるから覚悟して!
your heart will be shot down soon, don't forget!

161
00:17:23,024 --> 00:17:28,024
推し変なんて許さないんだから馬鹿にしてんじゃいの?
You can't just move on to someone else, are you making a fool of me?

162
00:17:33,824 --> 00:17:37,024
Baby Maniacs! 溺れちゃうの はやくあたしを連れ出して
Baby Maniacs! Drown me in your love, hurry up and carry me away.

163
00:17:41,024 --> 00:17:46,024
だめだめだめだめ おーいぇい!
No, no, no, no, oh yeah!

164
00:18:19,024 --> 00:18:23,824
箱にあたる陽を横目で眺めて
Glancing sideways at the sunlight hitting the box,

165
00:18:23,824 --> 00:18:29,624
そっと陰る木の根に一人で比べていた
I compared myself alone at the roots of the quietly shading tree.

166
00:18:29,824 --> 00:18:34,824
積もる溜息を吹き払うように
As if blowing away the piling sighs,

167
00:18:34,824 --> 00:18:41,224
そんな私を見つけてくれたんだ
you were the one who found me like that.

168
00:18:41,824 --> 00:18:44,824
そう それは恋のようなぬくもりを
Yes, wrapping all that warmth like love

169
00:18:44,824 --> 00:18:47,624
君に笑顔咲かせたら
and making a smile bloom on your face,

170
00:18:47,824 --> 00:18:52,324
桜風に踊る空 君と出会ったこの場所で
in the sky dancing with the cherry blossom breeze, at the place where I met you,

171
00:18:52,324 --> 00:18:56,324
どれくらいの思い出ぎゅっと溢れそうになるかな
I wonder how many memories are about to overflow.

172
00:18:56,324 --> 00:18:59,824
君と流した涙は 明日の笑顔の糧にしよう
The tears we shed together will become nourishment for tomorrow's smiles.

173
00:18:59,824 --> 00:19:04,324
膝をついていたってほら 何度だっていいよ
Even if we fell to our knees, see, any number of times is fine.

174
00:19:04,324 --> 00:19:09,324
意地を張って 恥をかいて
Putting up pride, feeling embarrassed,

175
00:19:09,324 --> 00:19:12,324
君が傍で見守ってくれたから
knowing that you watched over me by my side,

176
00:19:12,324 --> 00:19:15,824
追い風を受けてとまらない日々も
even days when we couldn't stop under a tailwind,

177
00:19:15,824 --> 00:19:19,324
そっと挫けそうになって心が疼いた
softly felt like giving up and my heart ached.

178
00:19:19,324 --> 00:19:24,324
積もる溜息でまた泣きかけても
Even if I almost cried again with piling sighs,

179
00:19:24,324 --> 00:19:29,824
あたたかな手でずっと支えてくれたんだ
you always supported me with your warm hands.

180
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:43,324
追い風を受けてとまらない日々も
Even days when we couldn't stop under a tailwind,

181
00:19:43,324 --> 00:19:46,824
そっと挫けそうになって心が疼いた
softly felt like giving up and my heart ached.

182
00:19:46,824 --> 00:19:51,324
積もる溜息でまた泣きかけても
Even if I almost cried again with piling sighs,

183
00:19:51,324 --> 00:19:58,524
あたたかな手でずっと支えてくれた
you always supported me with your warm hands.

184
00:20:04,275 --> 00:20:06,715
箱にあたる陽を横目で眺めて
Looking sideways at the sunlight hitting the box,

185
00:20:06,875 --> 00:20:09,155
そっと陰る木に一人で比べてた
I compared myself alone to the quietly darkening tree.

186
00:20:11,175 --> 00:20:13,375
