You were the one who found me like that.

188
00:20:17,015 --> 00:20:19,415
そう それは恋のような ぬくもりを全部
Yes, it's like love, all that warmth,

189
00:20:19,415 --> 00:20:21,855
君に笑顔咲かせるなら
If it makes a smile bloom on your face.

190
00:20:22,015 --> 00:20:26,935
桜風に踊る空 君と出会ったこの場所で
In this place where I met you, dancing in the cherry blossom breeze,

191
00:20:26,935 --> 00:20:29,655
どれくらいの思い出ぎゅっと 溢れそうになるかな
I wonder how many memories are about to overflow.

192
00:20:29,655 --> 00:20:32,335
君と流した涙は 明日の笑顔の糧にしよう
Let's turn the tears we shed together into nourishment for tomorrow's smiles.

193
00:20:32,335 --> 00:20:35,255
膝をついてたってほら 何度だっていいよ
Even if we dropped to our knees, hey, any number of times is fine.

194
00:20:40,375 --> 00:20:42,775
